    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d900">

                <pb facs="0711" n="595" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg595"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13161.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-11T20:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 11, 1914, 8 p.m. No.
                        2</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am in receipt of a formal communication from the Secretary of Foreign Relations
                    addressed to me and dated the 8th instant informing me that, the capital of the
                    Republic having been occupied by the Constitutionalist forces on the 21st of
                    August last and Don Venustiano Carranza having assumed the duties of the Chief
                    Executive of the nation, the Government has been duly installed, with seven
                    secretaries of State; their names and offices are given; the document concludes
                    as per following textual translation by me: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>With the desire of this Government to sustain the good relations of
                            friendship which have always united Mexico with your country, I will
                            receive with real satisfaction any representation which your Government
                            may think proper to make through your excellency. I improve the
                            opportunity to renew the assurances of my distinguished
                            consideration.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Isidro Fabela</hi>.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
